[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["舟中见雨","张以宁","五言律诗",["今夜初听雨，江南杜若青。","功名何卤莽，兄弟揔雕零。","远梦愁胡蝶，深情愧脊令。","抚孤终有意，身世尚流萍。"],0,"x32","明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["山茶 其一","陈淳","五言律诗",["丹葩间碧叶，雪中自重叠。","山人倚醉时，奈可映赪颊。"],0,126,"明"],["秋葵","陈淳","五言律诗",["长门秋晚露凄凄，双袖轻翻旧赐衣。","自笑不如桃与李，春风吹向上林飞。"],0,126,"明"],["水仙 其一","陈淳","五言律诗",["玉面婵娟小，檀心馥郁多。","盈盈仙骨在，端欲去凌波。"],0,126,"明"],["石榴二首","陈淳","五言律诗",["未摘霜前实，先看雨后花。","名应出西海，颜岂论东家。","蜡蒂团赪玉，文英簇绛绡。","秋来结佳果，珍味不须调。"],0,126,"明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["饮陈氏幽居","史谨","五言律诗",["落叶下萧萧，幽居远市朝。","偶成投辖饮，不待致书招。","塞雁冲寒过，山云傍槛飘。","此身何所似，天地一渔樵。"],0,85,"明"],["游王羽士山房","史谨","五言律诗",["落日半楼明，琳宫事事清。","山横万古色，鹤带九皋声。","易作神仙侣，难忘父子情。","道人应识我，未肯说长生。"],0,85,"明"],["忆家二首 其一","史谨","五言律诗",["新霁飏林初，苹花贴岸舒。","故乡今夜月，犹得照孤庐。"],0,85,"明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["送春日潘亚日黄农父陈元孝过饮南园","梁宪","五言律诗",["林静落黄梅，迟花应候开。","昼长闲睡足，酒熟故人来。","把袂忘言笑，看云共举杯。","醉歌惊鸟散，月上更登台。"],0,87,"明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["都昌怀旧隐二首 其一","魏观","五言律诗",["西斋风月好，庭草到阶前。","春服趋童冠，秋声杂诵弦。","题诗黄叶上，拄笏白云边。","俯仰成今古，离愁为黯然。"],0,46,"明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["辽左雪中登楼","许宗鲁","五言律诗",["岁杪崇朝雪，天涯绝塞城。","冻云连海色，枯木助风声。","怀土情无已，登楼赋未成。","梅花南国思，笛里暮愁生。"],0,72,"明"]]